    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful pirating requires the right tools! Equip your ship with different weapons, gadgets and mythical relics - as the captain, you have full control over the layout of your own ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLUNDER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter with different factions or sink their ships for some precious loot. You might even get lucky and discover an ancient treasure map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, enhance &amp; synergize! Almost everything can be upgraded, and then supercharged with clever equipment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIRATE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own pirate hideout to stash loot and expand your influence across the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ships, varying objectives and plenty of upgradable equipment -\u00a0<i>Roguebound Pirates</i> is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is in active development. You can join <strong>Discord</strong> to share ideas &amp; follow devlogs on <strong>YouTube</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3b6db0aabab8f838cd1654c6eb8b88be.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful pirating requires the right tools! Equip your ship with different weapons, gadgets and mythical relics - as the captain, you have full control over the layout of your own ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/00520acf0c6c7e2cc9debab9cab3d082.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLUNDER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter with different factions or sink their ships for some precious loot. You might even get lucky and discover an ancient treasure map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/504a665e42958f2eb04f7be264c23ac0.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, enhance &amp; synergize! Almost everything can be upgraded, and then supercharged with clever equipment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/d87880f60ed1de7b4fb0fd7a9a591f02.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIRATE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own pirate hideout to stash loot and expand your influence across the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3394ae754235b5f0fa96da7ab684455d.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ships, varying objectives and plenty of upgradable equipment -\u00a0<i>Roguebound Pirates</i> is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/586722d28840914cbdfce78cbc8f68a1.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is in active development. You can join <strong>Discord</strong> to share ideas &amp; follow devlogs on <strong>YouTube</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.poster.avif?t=1754026235\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.webm?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/3d4ccfa1bfecabc8bfd79476b66d744a.mp4?t=1754026235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
